# For the script events-union: the special events that favor the Union.
# May 1864, the Union plays. The Rebels hold Paducah (29), which was neutral at the start and
# has no army, so a riot can break out there. The Union's fleet has 9 ships, so that extra
# ships fill it to its limit of 10.
date 5 1864
owner 2 29
fleet 1 WWWWWWWWW 30
